### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Discover places with filters
GET http://localhost:3000/api/places?vibe=Local%20Food&city=Prishtina&budget=3&openNow=true

### AI recommendations
POST http://localhost:3000/api/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vibes": ["Hidden Gems", "Local Food"],
  "city": "Prizren",
  "budget": 3,
  "location": { "lat": 42.6629, "lng": 21.1655 },
  "dayPart": "EVENING",
  "partySize": 2
}

### Experience pulse
GET http://localhost:3000/api/pulse?city=Prishtina&vibe=Nightlife&dayPart=EVENING

### Track an engagement signal
POST http://localhost:3000/api/interactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "SAVE",
  "placeId": "soma-book-station",
  "city": "Prishtina",
  "vibe": "Hidden Gems",
  "metadata": {
    "source": "api.http",
    "transportPreference": "WALKING"
  }
}

### Itinerary generation
POST http://localhost:3000/api/itinerary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Perfect Evening in Prishtina",
  "city": "Prishtina",
  "budget": 60,
  "durationHours": 5,
  "interests": ["food", "nightlife", "culture"],
  "vibe": "Nightlife",
  "transportPreference": "WALKING"
}
